  Inter-family typefaces served from Google Fonts at runtime:
    Fraunces, Instrument Sans, JetBrains Mono — all SIL Open Font License 1.1.

  marked (MIT) and highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause), loaded from a CDN at runtime.

  Steel Browser (Apache License 2.0) — https://github.com/steel-dev/steel-browser
    The live browser behind browser_do, browser_page, and the rendered paths of
    web_search and browse_web. It is NOT bundled or redistributed here: it runs
    as a separate service the operator installs and starts themselves, and this
    project talks to it over its HTTP API and the CDP websocket it hands back.
    No Steel source is vendored into this repository.
    "Steel" and "Steel Browser" are the marks of their owners. This project is
    an independent user of that software and is not affiliated with, endorsed
    by, or sponsored by Steel.

  Playwright for Python (Apache License 2.0) — https://playwright.dev/python
    Drives the Steel session over CDP. Declared in requirements.txt; installed
    from PyPI, not vendored. Playwright's own browser download
    (`playwright install`) is deliberately not used — the browser is Steel's.

Python dependencies keep their own licenses; see requirements.txt.
